# Project: claude-handoff-skill

## Snapshot
- **Stage:** Review & Consolidation
- **Progress:** ~90% — V2.3 externally reviewed (8.5/10), quality standards codified, next version roadmap defined
- **Focus:** Lowering adoption barriers — not more features, simpler onboarding
- **Updated:** 2026-07-27

