- Q: 自动 SessionStart 走哪条路径？CLAUDE.md 模板 vs install 脚本 vs 等 Claude Code 原生 hook？
- Q: 是否需要 PROJECT.md（人类摘要层）与 PROJECT.ftmd（AI 用）分离？
- Q: 跨模型协议——PROJECT.ftmd 是否增加 Agent History（Provider / Model / Purpose）？
- Q: Test Handoff on a clean install (fresh Claude Code, no skills, no claude-mem) on all 3 platforms? → simulated in audit but not physically verified
- Q: Add test suite for the skill itself? → deferred from V2.1, still pending
